        "subject": "🚀 Your Google Maps Scrape Has Started!",
        "message": "=<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n  <h2 style=\"color: #4A90A4;\">🗺️ Scraping In Progress!</h2>\n  \n  <p>Hey there!</p>\n  \n  <p>Your lead scraping request is now running. Here's what we're searching for:</p>\n  \n  <table style=\"background: #f5f5f5; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; width: 100%;\">\n    <tr><td><strong>Business Type:</strong></td><td>{{ $json.businessType }}</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>Location:</strong></td><td>{{ $json.city }}</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>Started At:</strong></td><td>{{ $now.format('MMM dd, yyyy hh:mm a') }}</td></tr>\n  </table>\n  \n  <p style=\"margin-top: 20px;\">⏱️ <strong>Estimated time:</strong> 2-5 minutes depending on how many businesses we find.</p>\n  \n  <p>You'll receive another email with your completed results once scraping is done!</p>\n  \n  <div style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 15px; background: #e8f5e9; border-radius: 8px;\">\n    <p style=\"margin: 0;\"><strong>📊 Your Google Sheet:</strong></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 0;\"><a href=\"{{ $json.spreadsheetUrl }}\" style=\"color: #4285F4;\">{{ $json.spreadsheetUrl }}</a></p>\n  </div>\n  \n  <hr style=\"margin: 20px 0; border: none; border-top: 1px solid #eee;\">\n  \n  <p style=\"color: #888; font-size: 12px;\">Powered by Omar's AI Bot🤖</p>\n</div>",
