        "jsCode": "// Handle both first run and pagination runs\nconst input = $input.item.json;\n\n// If coming from pagination loop, use that data\nif (input.isPaginationRun) {\n  return input;\n}\n\n// First run - get data from Initialize Search Params\nconst searchParams = $('Initialize Search Params').item.json;\nreturn {\n  ...searchParams,\n  isPaginationRun: false\n};"
